    <briefdescription>
<para>One decoded ISO-TP frame (protocol data unit). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Only the members of the decoded frame type are meaningful; the others are zero. The payload is not copied: it is <computeroutput>frame[data_offset]</computeroutput> .. <computeroutput>frame[data_offset + data_length - 1]</computeroutput> of the frame passed to <ref refid="group__isotp__protocol_1ga29356e99657bbe884b0a15a5eedfcbce" kindref="member">isotp_decode</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
